WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.061
Rules are everywhere! Let's see some of them.

2
00:00:04.511 --> 00:00:07.112
At the zoo, you mustn't feed the animals.

3
00:00:07.562 --> 00:00:09.094
And you mustn't touch them!

4
00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:13.759
At the museum, you must buy a ticket.

5
00:00:14.209 --> 00:00:16.206
And you mustn't touch the paintings.

6
00:00:18.456 --> 00:00:21.243
When you ride a bike, you must wear a helmet.

7
00:00:23.493 --> 00:00:26.511
And in hospitals and schools, you mustn't smoke.

8
00:00:28.761 --> 00:00:32.151
And you? What rules are there at your work or school?

